7	// compares the list against the tiers. So the failure it cannot see is the
8	// quiet one: a new constant copied into both constants.ts and config.dart but
9	// never added to PAIRS compiles, passes every suite, and passes the pack's own
10	// checks — while the two copies are free to drift apart forever, which is the
11	// exact bug cross-tier-constants exists to catch.
