13	// The datum reconciled is "this constant is carried by both tiers", written
14	// down twice: once as a declaration in each tier's constants file, once as an
15	// entry in PAIRS. Like the pack's other guards it dictates no value, shape, or
16	// behaviour — its finding reads "make the copies agree", never "restore this
17	// constant".
